{"id":"f9dfa70ca901c287","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-massey-product.md","title":"Massey Product","display":"df-massey-product — Massey Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-massey-product","aliases":["58-df-massey-product"],"display":"df-massey-product — Massey Product","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-massey-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-massey-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-massey-product — Massey Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" href=\"?note=78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md\">../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,x,d,n,a\\in V\">\\(P,x,d,n,a\\in V\\)</span>。本文件沿用原六参数接口；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,R\">\\(X,R\\)</span> 使用上述固定结构，而不是无结构底集。所省略的结构参数是当前声明下的局部上下文，不允许在同一断言中更换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^r(\\sigma),Z^r(\\sigma),H^r(\\sigma),d_{\\sigma,r},[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,r}\">\\(C^r(\\sigma),Z^r(\\sigma),H^r(\\sigma),d_{\\sigma,r},[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,r}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\smile_{\\sigma,r,s}\">\\(\\smile_{\\sigma,r,s}\\)</span> 使用系数奇异链依赖中的实际构造；简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^r(X;R)=H^r(\\sigma)\">\\(H^r(X;R)=H^r(\\sigma)\\)</span>。所有上链和、整数倍均逐点取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n, q_{ij}(d),D(d,n)\">\\(I_n, q_{ij}(d),D(d,n)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge3\">\\(n\\ge3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega^n\">\\(d\\in\\omega^n\\)</span> 下定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(a,x,d,n)\">\\(\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\)</span> 下定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}\">\\(\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in(n+1)^2:i&lt;j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\ne\\langle0,n\\rangle\\},\\\\\nq_{ij}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\le k&lt;j}d(k)-(j-i-1),\\qquad\nD(d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}d(i)-(n-2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in(n+1)^2:i&lt;j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\ne\\langle0,n\\rangle\\},\\\\\nq_{ij}(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\le k&lt;j}d(k)-(j-i-1),\\qquad\nD(d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}d(i)-(n-2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(a,I_n,\\bigcup_{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n}C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;a(i,j)\\in C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(a(i,i+1)\\in Z^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\land[a(i,i+1)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,d(i)}=x(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;\n\\left(j&gt;i+1\\to d_{\\sigma,q_{ij}(d)}(a(i,j))\n=\\sum_{i&lt;k&lt;j}(-1)^{1+q_{ik}(d)}a(i,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{ik}(d),q_{kj}(d)}a(k,j)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(a,I_n,\\bigcup_{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n}C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;a(i,j)\\in C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(a(i,i+1)\\in Z^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\land[a(i,i+1)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,d(i)}=x(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;\n\\left(j&gt;i+1\\to d_{\\sigma,q_{ij}(d)}(a(i,j))\n=\\sum_{i&lt;k&lt;j}(-1)^{1+q_{ik}(d)}a(i,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{ik}(d),q_{kj}(d)}a(k,j)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{0&lt;k&lt;n}(-1)^{1+q_{0k}(d)}a(0,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{0k}(d),q_{kn}(d)}a(k,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{0&lt;k&lt;n}(-1)^{1+q_{0k}(d)}a(0,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{0k}(d),q_{kn}(d)}a(k,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\in Z^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\in Z^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}_S(P,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{z\\in H^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma):\\exists a\\;(\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\n\\land z=[\\mu(a,x,d,n)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,D(d,n)})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}_S(P,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\{z\\in H^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma):\\exists a\\;(\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\n\\land z=[\\mu(a,x,d,n)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,D(d,n)})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定义系统的索引、次数、代表元、全部微分方程以及最后的上闭链已列入 Assertion；不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 当作外部约定。</li>\n<li>使用 May 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u=(-1)^{1+\\deg u}u\">\\(\\bar u=(-1)^{1+\\deg u}u\\)</span> 符号约定。原文件没有固定符号约定；这里补齐缺少的选择，而不改动原有参数顺序或“所有定义系统所得类的集合”这一对象。</li>\n<li>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span> 表示不存在定义系统的情形；输入次数仍可为零。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>J. P. May, Matric Massey Products, Journal of Algebra 12 (1969), §1, Definition 1.2.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau_X,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"P,x,d,n,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X,R","display":false},{"tex":"C^r(\\sigma),Z^r(\\sigma),H^r(\\sigma),d_{\\sigma,r},[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\smile_{\\sigma,r,s}","display":false},{"tex":"H^r(X;R)=H^r(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"I_n, q_{ij}(d),D(d,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(a,x,d,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nI_n&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in(n+1)^2:i<j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\ne\\langle0,n\\rangle\\},\\\\\nq_{ij}(d)&\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\le k<j}d(k)-(j-i-1),\\qquad\nD(d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i\\in n}d(i)-(n-2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(a,I_n,\\bigcup_{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n}C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma))\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;a(i,j)\\in C^{q_{ij}(d)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;\\bigl(a(i,i+1)\\in Z^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\land[a(i,i+1)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,d(i)}=x(i)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I_n\\;\n\\left(j>i+1\\to d_{\\sigma,q_{ij}(d)}(a(i,j))\n=\\sum_{i<k<j}(-1)^{1+q_{ik}(d)}a(i,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{ik}(d),q_{kj}(d)}a(k,j)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\coloneqq\\sum_{0<k<n}(-1)^{1+q_{0k}(d)}a(0,k)\\smile_{\\sigma,q_{0k}(d),q_{kn}(d)}a(k,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\\to\n\\mu(a,x,d,n)\\in Z^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MasseyProduct}_S(P,x,d,n,X,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land n\\ge3\\land d\\in\\omega^n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,n,\\bigcup_{i\\in n}H^{d(i)}(\\sigma))\n\\land\\bigl[\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in H^{d(i)}(\\sigma)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land P=\\{z\\in H^{D(d,n)}(\\sigma):\\exists a\\;(\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S(a,x,d,n,X,R)\n\\land z=[\\mu(a,x,d,n)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,D(d,n)})\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefiningSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u=(-1)^{1+\\deg u}u","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":3692,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-823","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-massey-product.md|58-df-massey-product]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["78ee5e5ffa2f4a64","03f2d34d9851bee4","36d7463d215be751"]}